# Auto-deploy (bbooks-bmoim)

After finishing user-requested site updates (HTML, images, apply pages, etc.):

1. **Commit** the relevant changes (exclude `node_modules/`, `.DS_Store`, secrets, credentials).
2. **Push** to `origin main` so GitHub Pages at https://moim.bbooks.co.kr updates.
3. If local is behind remote, **merge** (or rebase) `origin/main` first; prefer the latest intentional local content for pages just edited.
4. Tell the user the deploy URL(s) briefly when done.

Do this without waiting for a separate "배포해줘" unless the user says not to deploy.
